WEBVTT

00:01:29.645 --> 00:01:34.311
“I… I don’t know what happened, 
but Sumi doesn’t have the Earth crystal.”

00:01:34.311 --> 00:01:36.541
So who ate which crystal?

00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:42.717
Pause now to figure it out for yourself.

00:01:42.717 --> 00:01:46.537
There’s no getting around it— 
this will take some trial and error.

00:01:46.537 --> 00:01:48.224
But that’s not a bad thing.

00:01:48.224 --> 00:01:49.953
If we make a wrong guess,

00:01:49.953 --> 00:01:53.963
we’ll eventually reach a point where 
our conclusions contradict each other.

00:01:53.963 --> 00:01:57.163
That would allow us to confirm 
that our initial guess was wrong

00:01:57.163 --> 00:01:58.583
and work from there.

00:01:58.583 --> 00:02:02.273
This is a technique 
known as proof by contradiction.